th your couch and covered with fresh\",\"end\":\"space\"},{\"n\":7,\"text\":\"and plentiful barks of trees-a way of living which is\",\"end\":\"space\"},{\"n\":8,\"text\":\"covetable.\",\"end\":\"space\"}],\"uncertain\":false,\"note\":null},\"r5\":{\"type\":\"translated_stanza\",\"lines\":[{\"n\":1,\"text\":\"28. There are the fruits of trees obtainable at will in\",\"end\":\"space\"},{\"n\":2,\"text\":\"every forest without difficulty; at intervals there is the cool\",\"end\":\"space\"},{\"n\":3,\"text\":\"and sweet water of sacred rivers; a bed made of the tender\",\"end\":\"space\"},{\"n\":4,\"text\":\"\",\"end\":\"space\"},{\"n\":5,\"text\":\"leaves of creepers is soft to the touch; ( although these are\",\"end\":\"space\"},{\"n\":6,\"text\":\"available ) mean persons do yet suffer pain at the gates of\",\"end\":\"space\"},{\"n\":7,\"text\":\"the rich.\",\"end\":\"space\"}],\"uncertain\":false,\"note\":null},\"r6\":{\"type\":\"translated_stanza\",\"lines\":[{\"n\":1,\"text\":\"29. Seated on a stony couch in the cavern of a mountain,\",\"end\":\"space\"},{\"n\":2,\"text\":\"may I, in the intervals of contemplation, recall, with an in-\",\"end\":\"hyphen\"},{\"n\":3,\"text\":\"ward smile, those days which seem to be longer to one\",\"end\":\"space\"},{\"n\":4,\"text\":\"experiencing the misery of (having to address) supplications\",\"end\":\"space\"},{\"n\":5,\"text\":\"to the wealthy and which ( days ) appear to be shorter\",\"end\":\"space\"},{\"n\":6,\"text\":\"( to one ) whose mind is tossed about by the allurement of\",\"end\":\"space\"},{\"n\":7,\"text\":\"sensual objects.\",\"end\":\"space\"}],\"uncertain\":false,\"note\":null},\"r1\":{\"type\":\"page_number\",\"lines\":[{\"n\":1,\"text\":\"[ 30 ]\",\"end\":\"space\"}],\"uncertain\":false,\"note\":null}},\"units\":[{\"id\":\"u1\",\"type\":\"translation\",\"number\":null,\"label\":null,\"open_start\":true,\"open_end\":true,\"children\":[\"u2\",\"u3\",\"u4\",\"u5\",\"u6\"]},{\"id\":\"u2\",\"type\":\"translate